-- two projects, alpha active --
  0 Workspace: workspace
  0 ● alpha
  0 ○ beta
  1 ▸ src
  1   main.bas
Add project file, from the menu on BETA's row
  action=project-file
  beta got the file=true
  the active project did not move=true
Delete, from the menu on main.bas -- it ARMS, as the header's does
  action=armed, main.bas is still there=true
Rename from the header: select main.bas, type a name, Rename
  action=renamed, start.bas exists=true, main.bas gone=true
Close project, from the menu on ALPHA's row
  action=project-closed
  0 Workspace: workspace
  0 ● beta
  1   .gstudio.json
  1   b.bas
  alpha's folder is untouched=true
the session toggle in Settings
  action=restore-off, checked=false
